{"about_the_game":"<strong>GASERB</strong> is a puzzle game developed by a single developer.<br><br>If you like difficult and cleverly designed puzzle games with a sprinkle of platformer mechanics then this game is for <strong>you</strong>.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Bar</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725990/extras/b3f511830c25b82c96c61be83977768e.poster.avif?t=1691097243\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725990/extras/b3f511830c25b82c96c61be83977768e.gif?t=1691097243\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>The game offers unique challenges on every level with its unique mechanic. A mechanic that can change how the game works.<br><br>Challenge the timer bar which can change how the game works and see if you're clever and fast enough to beat it.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Harpoon</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725990/extras/dde32c7c3c8cb349aed68467e2f4e0cd.poster.avif?t=1691097243\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725990/extras/dde32c7c3c8cb349aed68467e2f4e0cd.webm?t=1691097243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725990/extras/dde32c7c3c8cb349aed68467e2f4e0cd.mp4?t=1691097243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Portals</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725990/extras/5a73292162919f1e902412a9f7c63d9f.poster.avif?t=1691097243\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"h